  S3: Identify which bills still have an amount owed and extract their due dates. (done when: Each bill's status and amount fields are interpreted, and the 
outstanding subset with due dates is determined.)
  S4: Produce the final answer to the requester. (done when: The report lists outstanding bills with vendor name, invoice number, ERP bill ID, amount owed, and 
due date, or clearly states there is no outstanding balance.)
